s da cidade.\nEste empreendimento esta localizado bem no coração do Bigorrilho, e oferece a você não apenas conforto, mas segurança e comodidades de um condomínio repleto de belas áreas de lazer.\n(41) 99223 - 6006\nwww.v6imoveis.com.br\nAs informações estão sujeitas a alterações. Consulte o corretor responsável.","fotos":["https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/ff597fec-5d92-47ad-86b8-4e23732e95fd/images/0513ed3e-7b50-41e8-a290-7f313a09fdbb1795013363GHCJ.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/ff597fec-5d92-47ad-86b8-4e23732e95fd/images/43a84e61-0387-4d63-8ad8-9552ce9f2f8d1795013363H0Wt.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/ff597fec-5d92-47ad-86b8-4e23732e95fd/images/9004f0e7-fc92-468d-abbe-26e116aba3c21795013353uMGp.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/ff597fec-5d92-47ad-86b8-4e23732e95fd/images/3eb7f855-fb34-4a42-aedf-1804016636a61795013356kzzz.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/ff597fec-5d92-47ad-86b8-4e23732e95fd/images/c6f3f00b-3347-46b7-b750-a52bc500302b1795013357t8xk.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/ff597fec-5d92-47ad-86b8-4e23732e95fd/images/81b0cbb4-cbae-44e2-99c5-bcbc6538473e1795013353ZRZ0.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/ff597fec-5d92-47ad-86b8-4e23732e95fd/images/066e6611-ce1b-42aa-9b90-7bc78a4f20e41795013358VZR4.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/ff597fec-5d92-47ad-86b8-4e23732e95fd/images/e87225e0-f349-4b2f-94ca-ea6409847db01795013353sG5M.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/ff597fec-5d92-47ad-86b8-4e23732e95fd/images/2fcdc013-89df-44b2-af71-55efefcf93d31795013353aHIN.jpg","